# This repository publishes the rendered site only.
#
# GitHub Pages serves docs/ from main. Everything else in this folder stays on
# this machine: the chapters, the figures, the theme, the gate scripts, the
# working notes, and the archived first edition at v1/. CNAME, .nojekyll and v1/
# are copied into docs/ on every render by `resources:` in _quarto.yml, so the
# published site carries them without this repository tracking the originals.
#
# Chapters 3 and 4 are drafted but held back. They are ignored here as well as
# commented out of the chapters list, so that holding them back means something.
#
# This is deliberately the arrangement MIRROR.md replaces. Until the private
# source repository exists, the second edition's manuscript is backed up nowhere
# except this machine. Setting up the mirror is the fix, and it is ten minutes.
# When you do, replace this file with the one that tracks everything.

/*

!/.gitignore
!/docs/
!/CNAME
!/.nojekyll
!/README.md

/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb
